<p style="text-align:center;" data-zesty-id="content:textarea:40:61">
							Our youth community programs enable children to experience music and art education in positive, safe&nbsp;environments. Our wide array of classes focuses on everything from choir, band, and dancing to drawing, photography, writing, and acting.
						</p>
				</div>
<div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12" data-zesty-id="design:columns:2columns:43:63-1:2 Columns - Equal:1">
<h6 class="greyBoxes-title" style="text-align:center;" data-zesty-id="content:text:41:70"><i class="icon icon-family"></i> Spiritual Mentorship</h6>
<p style="text-align:center;" data-zesty-id="content:textarea:42:6">
							Each Red Shield Youth Center is dedicated to helping students discover their own relationship with God. From devotionals and chapel services, to having mentors at the Youth Center&nbsp;passionate about helping people on their journey.&nbsp;
						</p>
