<h5 style="text-align:center;" data-zesty-id="content:text:89:92">Make a difference in the life of a child</h5>
<p style="text-align:center;" data-zesty-id="content:textarea:90:15">Sponsorships for The Salvation Army Red Shield Youth Centers empower youth through safe spaces &amp; learning opportunities. Join us in supporting a brighter future for our youth.</p>
<p style="text-align:center;" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:91:35"><a href="https://southernusa.salvationarmy.org/tulsa-area-command/red-shield-youth-centers"><span class="btn btn-solid btn-red">Sponsorships</span></a></p>
